#. module: stock_capture
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_capture.field_stock_capture_profile__replace_quantity
msgid ""
"A confirmed reading replaces the quantity already captured instead of being "
"added to it: the done quantity of the detailed operation in transfers and "
"the counted quantity in inventories."
msgstr ""
"Una lectura confirmada sustituye la cantidad ya capturada en lugar de "
"sumarse a ella: la cantidad hecha de la operación detallada en traslados y "
"la cantidad contada en inventarios."

#. module: stock_capture
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:stock_capture.stock_capture_profile_action
msgid ""
"A profile sets how the screens reading or weighing quantities\n"
"                behave on an operation type. Analyze the flow of each "
"operation\n"
"                with the people doing it and adjust a profile to it."
msgstr ""
"Un perfil define cómo se comportan las pantallas que leen o pesan "
"cantidades\n"
"                en un tipo de operación. Analice el flujo de cada operación\n"
"                con las personas que la realizan y ajuste un perfil a él."

#. module: stock_capture
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_capture.field_stock_capture_profile_field__required
